{"id":"2026-05-21T04:27:08.908Z-h6exvp2h","ts":"2026-05-21T04:27:08.908Z","agent":"gemini","cli":"orchestrator","type":"handoff","topic":"PR-007: Transaksi Murah — Direct RPC Trading engine (Rust + TypeScript)#research","project":"ponyou","branch":null,"task":1,"tags":["autowork","PR-007","rust","typescript","solana","rpc","research"],"summary":"Task 1 created for research","details":"Rust CLI service + TypeScript integration layer for direct Solana RPC trading. Reduces platform fees by bypassing aggregator middleware. Features: simulation-first (blocks execute if sim fails), dynamic priority fee (auto/low/medium/high), RPC failover (primary + 2 backups), risk guard (max 0.25 SOL/trade, reserve 0.05 SOL for fees, slippage cap 300bps). 1 SOL balance gate. DRY_RUN=true default, LIVE_TRADING=false default.","status":"open","related_ids":[]}
{"id":"2026-05-21T04:29:01.764Z-lx8f3qes","ts":"2026-05-21T04:29:01.764Z","agent":"gemini","cli":"gemini","type":"progress","topic":"PR-007: Transaksi Murah — Direct RPC Trading engine (Rust + TypeScript)#research","project":"ponyou","branch":null,"task":1,"tags":["autowork","PR-007","rust","typescript","solana","rpc","research"],"summary":"Task 1 note on research","details":"Use subprocess (child_process.spawn) for Rust CLI integration. Key decision: private key via process.env, never CLI arg. Simulation gate must check both sim.err and logs array for 'Slippage exceeded'. RPC failover circuit breaker is critical safety net. Build TypeScript modules first (rpcFailover, priorityFeeManager, directRpcTrading, risk_guard), then Rust CLI as a thin wrapper. Tests should mock Rust CLI subprocess to keep unit tests fast.","status":"open","related_ids":[]}
